# Architecture

- Layers: `cli` → `analysis/pipeline` → `{github, git, analysis, semantic, cache}`. `tui` → `pipeline`, `review_scope`, `prefs`, `models`.
- `tui/` never imports `semantic/`. `semantic/` never imports `tui/`.
- `src/harpy/analysis/scoring.py` imports only `harpy.models` plus stdlib/pydantic.
- `subprocess` is banned except in `src/harpy/proc.py`. All process launches go through `harpy.proc.run`.
- Analyzer role is read-only (`--mode ask`). Do not give semantic analysis `--force`.
- Pinned default model: `cursor-grok-4.6-high-fast`. Per-scope override is allowed in the review-scope dialog.
- This repo has no git remote. Do not `gh repo create` or `git remote add`.
